      "stars": "0"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "Have not listened to the recording yet, as far as the show, thought it started out a litle slow and began to pick up steam, but finished strong.  The second set was incredible from the beginning to the end.  One great jam after another.",
      "reviewtitle": "Sick Second Set",
      "reviewer": "ctdeadhead1",
      "reviewdate": "2012-07-16 12:35:48",
      "createdate": "2012-07-16 12:35:48",
      "stars": "4"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "I'm only at BTW but I need to immediately express my heartfelt gratitude to Bill Goldberg for a wonderful recording and super-fast upload. It's amazing how last night I was following @deadheadland's updates from Bethel and this morning I'm lucky enough to listen to the show on LMA. Grateful. Always.",
      "reviewtitle": "you can see that it's true",
